[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Surprise Attack</h2>
<i>"Oh oh..."<br>
--=DDC=Striker</i>  

<p>Fighting a valiant battle, you defeated the War Fortress. Unfortunately, this was just a trick to lure you away. In the meanwhile, the Razorians set up a great scale attack against the DDC-Center! You received the emergency message, calling all islands back to the DDC-Center. Only you and Defense Island Cristalvobol (DIC) could reach it in time to prevent the destruction of DDC.

<p>DIC: "<i>Hurry up, the attack has already begun! There are four islands of Wind, Sun, Rain and Thunder! Let's destroy those villains!</i>"

<p>Your mission is to defeat the Razorians attacking the DDC-Center.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[BadTeamDead]
<h2>Well done!</h2>
<p>
We have won and narrowly escaped from destruction! You are truly a great commander!

<$Config,Done{mission.filename}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,Razorianreturn4

[ai2PriestDead]
<p>Defense Island Cristalvobol is gone! Now it's gonna be a lot harder!

$Button=Continue,DoNothing,0

[ai3PriestDead]
<p>DDC-Center South has been defeated! DDC, now without command center is falling apart as we speak!

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[ai4PriestDead]
<p>DDC-Center North is lost! Without storm power, DDC soon lost the battle.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
You are dead! The DDC-Center is also defeated and that ends DDC's existance!

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[END]